1
00:00:00,266 --> 00:00:03,806
And that there'd be an asterisk by his name
because he'd be a cyborg.

2
00:00:05,104 --> 00:00:08,484
So you got a little competition.
I really don't see what the big deal is.

3
00:00:08,649 --> 00:00:12,779
(Sheldon:)Of course you don't.
You've never excelled at anything.

4
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:17,490
(Penny:)I don't understand, exactly how did
he get any friends in the first place?

5
00:00:18,326 --> 00:00:20,616
(Howard:)We liked Leonard.

6
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:24,120
What are you gonna do, just give up?

7
00:00:24,624 --> 00:00:29,374
Yes, it's what a rational person does
when his entire life's work is invalidated...

8
00:00:29,545 --> 00:00:32,335
(Sheldon:)...by a postpubescent Asian wunderkind.

9
00:00:32,965 --> 00:00:37,465
(Sheldon:)He ceases his fruitless efforts,
he donates his body to scientific research...

10
00:00:37,637 --> 00:00:40,177
(Sheldon:)...and he waits to die.

11
00:00:41,349 --> 00:00:46,229
(Penny:)I'm confused again. Is he waiting, or do
we get to shoot him between the eyes?

12
00:00:48,856 --> 00:00:50,646
(Penny(opening door):)- Hey.
- Hey.

13
00:00:50,817 --> 00:00:52,197
(Sheldon:)I've decided you're right.

14
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:54,530
(Sheldon:)- My career is not over.
- Great.

15
00:00:54,695 --> 00:00:57,735
But since Dennis Kim
has rendered my research pointless...

16
00:00:57,907 --> 00:01:00,367
(Sheldon:)...I just have to find
something else to focus on.

